# 📖 TOEFL Reading - Day 07

## Passage

Many universities encourage students to participate in research projects. These experiences help students develop critical thinking skills and prepare them for future careers.

---

## Question

Why do universities encourage research projects?

A. To reduce homework

B. To help students develop skills for the future

C. To shorten classes

D. To increase tuition fees

---

## Answer

B. To help students develop skills for the future.

---

## Key Vocabulary

- encourage = 장려하다
- participate = 참여하다
- critical thinking = 비판적 사고
- prepare = 준비시키다
